title: "The Sir Whiskerton Universe"
abstract: "A collection of bilingual fables, character biographies, worldbuilding documents, and teaching materials set on a farm where belonging is unconditional, joy is resistance, and every creature—no matter how absurd, broken, or strange—finds a home."
